<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Blue Box Pass to Wapinitia Ridge</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:162-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.209566" lon="-121.698959"><ele>1230.4</ele><name>Blue Box Pass turnout (Y-junction)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:blue-box-pass-sno-park (OSM node 36208327, the pass); Road 220 and NF 2660 both start within 40 m; confidence: high; pdf_page: 164; book_elev_ft: 4030; quote: At the Blue Box Pass parking turnout there is a Y-junction. The left fork goes to Clear Lake, and the right fork goes to Wapinitia Ridge.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.213132" lon="-121.704402"><ele>1321.3</ele><name>First clearcut (Road 220 bend, NE corner)</name><desc>source: OSM road 220 at 0.47 mi, where it turns north-east; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 164; quote: Ski the uphill, moderately steep branch 0.5 mile to the first clearcut ... Exit the clearcut at its northeast corner</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.218555" lon="-121.706806"><ele>1344.5</ele><name>Road 220 / Road 221 fork</name><desc>source: OSM node shared by roads 220 and 221, 220 at 0.98 mi: sketch map 36's 1.0 dot where the 0.7 spur (road 221, 0.68 mi) leaves; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 164; quote: map 36: 1.0 from the sno-park to the fork, 0.6 + 0.5 on to the 4600' clearcut</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.211880" lon="-121.720000"><ele>1361.4</ele><name>Farthest clearcut (end of Road 220)</name><desc>source: OSM road 220's west end, 2.08 mi; 0.98 + 1.1 = 2.08 as the text's 1.1 from the fork; map 36: 1.0 + 0.6 + 0.5 = 2.1; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 164; quote: continue on the road 1.1 miles to the farthest clearcut, with a view of Hood</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.215397" lon="-121.714030"><ele>1338.2</ele><name>Road 220 / spur 222 (turn right)</name><desc>source: OSM node shared by roads 220 and 222, 0.42 mi back from the road end; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 164; quote: On your return, ski only 0.5 mile then turn right (southwest) on a road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.212880" lon="-121.715380"><ele>1378.9</ele><name>Top of the long clearcut (end of spur 222), high point</name><desc>source: OSM spur 222's south-west end; DEM 4,580 ft on the ridge top, the tour's 4,600 ft high point; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 164; book_elev_ft: 4600; quote: enter the top of a long, southward-sloping clearcut ... off-road skiing through clearcuts to a high point of 4,600 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.207000" lon="-121.714000"><ele>1384.6</ele><name>Lower end of the long clearcut</name><desc>source: 0.41 mi due south of the top down the ridge's gentle south slope (DEM 4,580 to about 4,550 ft); placed from the text; confidence: low; pdf_page: 164; quote: Ski 0.5 mile to its lower end with views of the Mutton Mountains near Kah-Nee-Ta.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.209200" lon="-121.709500"><ele>1308.6</ele><name>On map 36's 0.7 connector</name><desc>source: placed on the sketch's 0.7 line from the lower clearcut east-northeast to the first clearcut; DEM about 4,330 ft, between the bottom (4,550) and the first clearcut (4,275); not Road 221's end; confidence: low; pdf_page: 164; quote: Then ski a road at the bottom eastward and back to the first clearcut you entered for a loop return.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.212207" lon="-121.705145"><ele>1303.1</ele><name>Back at the first clearcut (Road 220)</name><desc>source: OSM road 220 at 0.40 mi; confidence: low; pdf_page: 164; quote: Then ski a road at the bottom eastward and back to the first clearcut you entered for a loop return.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.209566" lon="-121.698959"><ele>1230.4</ele><name>Blue Box Pass turnout (end of loop)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:blue-box-pass-sno-park (OSM node 36208327, the pass); Road 220 and NF 2660 both start within 40 m; confidence: high; pdf_page: 164; book_elev_ft: 4030; quote: for a loop return</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Blue Box Pass to Wapinitia Ridge</name><desc>1. Blue Box Pass turnout (Y-junction) -&gt; First clearcut (Road 220 bend, NE corner): osm (high), 0.49 mi | 2. First clearcut (Road 220 bend, NE corner) -&gt; Road 220 / Road 221 fork: osm (high), 0.51 mi | 3. Road 220 / Road 221 fork -&gt; Farthest clearcut (end of Road 220): osm (high), 1.10 mi | 4. Farthest clearcut (end of Road 220) -&gt; Road 220 / spur 222 (turn right): osm (high), 0.42 mi | 5. Road 220 / spur 222 (turn right) -&gt; Top of the long clearcut (end of spur 222), high point: osm (medium), 0.21 mi | 6. Top of the long clearcut (end of spur 222), high point -&gt; Lower end of the long clearcut: straight (low), 0.41 mi | 7. Lower end of the long clearcut -&gt; On map 36's 0.7 connector: straight (low), 0.27 mi | 8. On map 36's 0.7 connector -&gt; Back at the first clearcut (Road 220): straight (low), 0.30 mi | 9. Back at the first clearcut (Road 220) -&gt; Blue Box Pass turnout (end of loop): osm (high), 0.42 mi</desc>
